\title{Happy Birthday, [[plotkin]]}
\author{liamoc}
\date{2026-09-08}
\p{We had a celebration of [[plotkin]]'s eightieth birthday today, featuring many interesting talks. It's hard \em{not} to run into Gordon's work if you do anything involving semantics or concurrency or programming languages. My favourite talk of the day was probably my friend [[xnning]]'s talk, but I also enjoyed [[rvg]]'s talk on his Justness work.}
\p{My only major Gordon anecdote is that he was on my interview panel when I interviewed for the job at the [[uoe]], and I was astounded to realise that not only was he still alive, but also he somehow didn't appear much older than any of the famous pictures of him. }
\p{So, congratulations and happy birthday to the timeless Gordon Plotkin, a huge contributor to our field and an intellectual hero to many of us. }